Notes related to bmail suite v0.2

This release fixes a S/MIME error introduced by a flaw in blank line 
handling. Run the bmail script n a terminal after your MX, DNS, and ION are 
correctly configured.

A code refactor (v0.3) is underway, introducing dtpc elision and reliability 
services, as well as zlib compression of payloads.  That code can be found 
in dtpc/test/ .  To switch to that code, which compiles, but has a 
decompression data corruption bug, in addition to needing a while loop to 
process output (maybe), comment the relevant sections in the BPv7 section of 
Makefile.am, and uncomment the relevant sections in the DTPC section.  To 
implement v0.3, dtpcd configuration in ION is required.

